 of Science and Technology</span></h5><h5 class=\"media-heading\"><small>China</small></h5></div></div></a></div><div class=\"col-sm-6\"><a href=\"https://conf.researchr.org/profile/ase-2026/yepangliu\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"navigate\"><div class=\"media\"><span class=\"pull-left\"><img alt=\"Yepang Liu\" src=\"https://conf.researchr.org/getProfileImage/yepangliu/4a771d06-e11e-4d8d-96c8-095a77f5c97c/micro-avatar?1793538910000\" class=\"outputimage media-object thumbnail no-bottom-margin\"/></span><div class=\"media-body\"><h5 class=\"media-heading\">Yepang Liu<span class=\"pull-right\"><small></small></span></h5><h5 class=\"media-heading\"><span class=\"text-black\">Southern University of Science and Technology</span></h5><h5 class=\"media-heading\"><small>China</small></h5></div></div></a></div></div></div><br></div><div class=\"modal-footer\"><span class=\"pull-left\"><a href=\"https://conf.researchr.org/details/ase-2026/ase-2026-research-track/44/WebCQ-Cooperative-Multi-agent-Deep-Reinforcement-Learning-for-Scalable-Web-GUI-Testi\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"btn btn-default navigate\"><span class=\"glyphicon glyphicon-new-window\"></span> All Details</a></span><a href=\"#\" data-dismiss=\"modal\" class=\"btn btn-default\"><span class=\"glyphicon glyphicon-remove\"></span> Close</a></div></div></div></div>"},{ "action": "runscript", "value": "$('#modal-3657bdf5-6353-4682-ab87-cd74fc5e831c').modal({ backdrop: 'static', keyboard: true}, 'show');" },
